		lagi; tidak dihitung ulang. Sumber: \
		Database_Terpadu_Empiris_Sosial_MR1_KUPS_20HD_V52 (MASTER_20HD_MR1); File \
		A sheet Patroli (log 2023). Status: EMPIRICAL_CONDITIONAL.
